OL,3,GNEWSAMurder trial hears of King's
OL,4,ACoronation claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a woman and
OL,7,Fhiding her body in a freezer told her
OL,8,Ffriends they had been to the King's
OL,9,FCoronation and were greeted by Sir
OL,10,FStephen Fry and Dame Joanna Lumley, a
OL,11,Fcourt heard.
OL,13,FGeorge Gordon, 65, allegedly murdered
OL,14,Fhis artist "soulmate" Delia McInerney,
OL,15,F62, in April 2023, days before she was
OL,16,Fdue to move to Portugal for a "new
OL,17,Flife".
OL,19,FHer dismembered body was found in
OL,20,FGordon's flat in St Helens on
OL,21,FMerseyside, in January this year, along
OL,22,Fwith her five dead guinea pigs.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
